for the DATA LAYER 


The sequence you'll follow:
Scrapers → Validation Gate 1 → MongoDB → Transform → Validation Gate 2 → PostgreSQL
Airflow comes LAST after everything works manually first.

Step 1 right now: Build the scrapers
You need 3 scrapers (Aqarmap, OLX, Bayut) but start with one — Aqarmap, it's the most structured.
Before writing a single line of code though, you need to do this manually first:

Open Aqarmap.com
Find a property listing
Inspect the page (F12 → Elements)
Identify where these fields live in the HTML: price, area, location, floor, rooms, bathrooms, finishing, furnished, compound, property_type
